<view class="screen"><view class="mode-banner">{{modeLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{imageError}}" class="note">部分图片暂时无法读取，请稍后刷新。商品和订单信息以文字为准。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取好物…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}">重新读取</button><button class="text-button" data-page="mine" bindtap="go">前往我的</button></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="order-status"><text class="eyebrow">SIMULATED ORDER</text><text class="page-title">{{order.statusText}}</text><text class="small">订单状态保留云端／本机当前模式记录，均不代表真实交易。</text></view><view wx:if="{{cartPending}}" class="surface"><text class="body-copy">订单已生成，购物车清理尚待核对，不影响订单成功。</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="retryCart" loading="{{processing}}">重试核对购物车</button></view><view class="surface"><view class="section-title"><text class="heading">订单好物</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh">刷新</button></view><view wx:for="{{order.lines}}" wx:key="key" class="order-product"><image binderror="imageFailed" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="grow"><text class="product-title">{{item.product}}</text><text class="muted small">{{item.variantLabel}} · {{item.weight}}</text><text class="body-copy">¥{{item.priceText}} × {{item.quantity}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.batchCode}}" class="muted tiny">批次 {{item.batchCode}}</text></view></view><view class="info-row"><text>模拟合计（含运费）</text><text class="price">¥{{order.totalText}}</text></view><text class="small muted">实际付款 ¥0.00</text></view><view class="surface"><text class="heading">订单信息</text><view class="info-row"><text class="muted">订单编号</text><text selectable class="break">{{order.id}}</text></view><view class="info-row"><text class="muted">生成时间</text><text>{{order.createdText}}</text></view><view class="info-row"><text class="muted">示例地区</text><text>{{order.address}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{order.fulfillment}}"><view class="info-row"><text class="muted">演示物流</text><text>{{order.fulfillment.carrier}}</text></view><view class="info-row"><text class="muted">模拟单号</text><text selectable class="break">{{order.fulfillment.tracking}}</text></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{cancellation}}" class="note">{{cancellation}}</view><view class="surface"><text class="heading">订单与售后记录</text><text class="small muted">仅展示已保存的模拟操作，时间为北京时间，不代表快递实时轨迹。</text><view wx:for="{{timeline}}" wx:key="id" class="order-event"><view class="event-dot"></view><view class="grow"><text class="event-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="small muted">{{item.time}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.detail}}" class="body-copy">{{item.detail}}</text></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{order.afterSale}}" class="surface"><view class="section-title"><text class="heading">售后进度</text><text class="status-tag">{{order.afterLabel}}</text></view><text class="body-copy">{{order.afterType}} · {{order.afterSale.description || '未填写补充描述'}}</text><text wx:if="{{order.afterSale.merchantReply}}" class="reply">商家意见：{{order.afterSale.merchantReply}}</text><button wx:if="{{order.afterSale.status === 'submitted'}}" class="secondary" data-action="withdraw" bindtap="operate" disabled="{{processing}}">撤回模拟售后</button></view><view class="button-stack"><button wx:if="{{order.canReceive}}" class="primary" data-action="receive" bindtap="operate" loading="{{processing}}" disabled="{{processing}}">确认模拟收货</button><button wx:if="{{order.canApply}}" class="secondary" data-page="aftersale" data-id="{{order.id}}" bindtap="go" disabled="{{processing}}">申请售后</button><button wx:if="{{order.canCancel}}" class="text-button" data-action="cancel" bindtap="operate" disabled="{{processing}}">取消模拟订单</button></view><view wx:if="{{mode === 'mock'}}" class="surface mock-tools"><text class="heading">本机完整流程体验</text><text class="body-copy">下面两个按钮仅在本机模拟模式出现，替你扮演商家；云端模式由获授权的商家处理。</text><button wx:if="{{order.canMockShip}}" class="secondary" data-action="ship" bindtap="operate" loading="{{processing}}" disabled="{{processing}}">模拟商家发货</button><button wx:if="{{order.canMockResolve}}" class="secondary" data-action="resolve" bindtap="operate" loading="{{processing}}" disabled="{{processing}}">模拟售后处理完成</button></view><button class="text-button" data-page="orders" bindtap="go">返回我的订单</button></view><view class="bottom-space"></view></view>
